  "title": "INFINITELY MANY RIEMANN SURFACES WITH A TRANSITIVE ACTION ON THE WEIERSTRASS POINTS",
  "authors_raw": "SEBASTI ÁN REYES-CAROCCA AND PIETRO SPEZIALI",
  "abstract": "In this short note, we prove the existence of inﬁnitely many pairwise non-isomorphic, non-hyperelliptic Riemann surfaces with automorp hism group act- ing transitively on the Weierstrass points. We also ﬁnd all compact Rie mann sur- faces with automorphism group acting transitively on the Weierstra ss points, under the assumption that they are simple.",
